  <body>
    <div id="root"><div class="app"><header class="header"><div class="brand"><div class="brand-mark">S</div><div><h1>SkillGraph</h1><p>Career intelligence powered by graph data</p></div></div><div class="status"><span class="status-dot"></span>CognoDB Connected</div></header><main class="main-container"><section class="hero"><div class="hero-content"><span class="eyebrow">GRAPH-POWERED CAREER EXPLORER</span><h2>Discover where your<span> skills </span>can take you.</h2><p>Explore the connection between your skills, career opportunities, and companies using SkillGraph.</p></div></section><section class="control-card"><div><p class="section-label">SELECT PROFILE</p><h3>Explore your career path</h3><p class="muted">Discover connected skills, jobs and companies.</p></div><div class="select-wrapper"><label>User</label><strong>Ravi Sukanya</strong><button type="button" fdprocessedid="cdi241">Logout</button></div></section><section class="section"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="section-label">CONNECTED SKILLS</p><h3>Ravi Sukanya's Skills</h3></div><span class="count-badge">5 skills</span></div><div class="skills-grid"><div class="skill-card"><div class="skill-icon">✦</div><span>JavaScript</span></div><div class="skill-card"><div class="skill-icon">✦</div><span>Node.js</span></div><div class="skill-card"><div class="skill-icon">✦</div><span>Python</span></div><div class="skill-card"><div class="skill-icon">✦</div><span>React</span></div><div class="skill-card"><div class="skill-icon">✦</div><span>SQL</span></div></div></section><section class="graph-section"><div class="section-label">GRAPH EXPLORER</div><div class="graph-heading"><div><h2>How Ravi Sukanya's career graph connects</h2><p>Follow the relationships from user → skills → jobs → companies.</p></div><div class="graph-badge">13 nodes</div></div><div class="graph-container"><div class="graph-column"><div class="graph-column-title">USER</div><div class="graph-node user-node"><span class="node-icon">●</span><strong>Ravi Sukanya</strong></div></div><div class="graph-arrow">→</div><div class="graph-column"><div class="graph-column-title">SKILLS</div><div class="graph-node skill-node"><span class="node-icon">✦</span><strong>JavaScript</strong></div><div class="graph-node skill-node"><span class="node-icon">✦</span><strong>Node.js</strong></div><div class="graph-node skill-node"><span class="node-icon">✦</span><strong>Python</strong></div><div class="graph-node skill-node"><span class="node-icon">✦</span><strong>React</strong></div><div class="graph-node skill-node"><span class="node-icon">✦</span><strong>SQL</strong></div></div><div class="graph-arrow">→</div><div class="graph-column"><div class="graph-column-title">JOBS</div><div class="graph-node job-node"><span class="node-icon">◆</span><strong>Frontend Developer</strong></div><div class="graph-node job-node"><span class="node-icon">◆</span><strong>Full Stack Developer</strong></div><div class="graph-node job-node"><span class="node-icon">◆</span><strong>Backend Developer</strong></div><div class="graph-node job-node"><span class="node-icon">◆</span><strong>Data Analyst</strong></div></div><div class="graph-arrow">→</div><div class="graph-column"><div class="graph-column-title">COMPANIES</div><div class="graph-node company-node"><span class="node-icon">●</span><strong>Google</strong></div><div class="graph-node company-node"><span class="node-icon">●</span><strong>TCS</strong></div><div class="graph-node company-node"><span class="node-icon">●</span><strong>Microsoft</strong></div><div class="graph-node company-node"><span class="node-icon">●</span><strong>Infosys</strong></div></div></div><div class="relationship-bar"><span>HAS_SKILL</span><span>→</span><span>REQUIRED_FOR</span><span>→</span><span>OFFERED_BY</span></div></section><section class="section"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="section-label">GRAPH TRAVERSAL</p><h3>Career Opportunities</h3></div><span class="count-badge">9 paths</span></div><div class="career-grid"><article class="career-card"><div class="card-number">01</div><div class="path"><div class="path-item"><span class="path-type">SKILL</span><strong>JavaScript</strong></div><div class="path-line"></div><div class="path-item"><span class="path-type">JOB</span><strong>Frontend Developer</strong></div><div class="path-line"></div><div class="path-item company-item"><span class="path-type">COMPANY</span><strong>Google</strong></div></div></article><article class="career-card"><div class="card-number">02</div><div class="path"><div class="path-item"><span class="path-type">SKILL</span><strong>JavaScript</strong></div><div class="path-line"></div><div class="path-item"><span class="path-type">JOB</span><strong>Full Stack Developer</strong></div><div class="path-line"></div><div class="path-item company-item"><span class="path-type">COMPANY</span><strong>TCS</strong></div></div></article><article class="career-card"><div class="card-number">03</div><div class="path"><div class="path-item"><span class="path-type">SKILL</span><strong>Node.js</strong></div><div class="path-line"></div><div class="path-item"><span class="path-type">JOB</span><strong>Backend Developer</strong></div><div class="path-line"></div><div class="path-item company-item"><span class="path-type">COMPANY</span><strong>Microsoft</strong></div></div></article><article class="career-card"><div class="card-number">04</div><div class="path"><div class="path-item"><span class="path-type">SKILL</span><strong>Node.js</strong></div><div class="path-line"></div><div class="path-item"><span class="path-type">JOB</span><strong>Full Stack Developer</strong></div><div class="path-line"></div><div class="path-item company-item"><span class="path-type">COMPANY</span><strong>TCS</strong></div></div></article><article class="career-card"><div class="card-number">05</div><div class="path"><div class="path-item"><span class="path-type">SKILL</span><strong>Python</strong></div><div class="path-line"></div><div class="path-item"><span class="path-type">JOB</span><strong>Backend Developer</strong></div><div class="path-line"></div><div class="path-item company-item"><span class="path-type">COMPANY</span><strong>Microsoft</strong></div></div></article><article class="career-card"><div class="card-number">06</div><div class="path"><div class="path-item"><span class="path-type">SKILL</span><strong>Python</strong></div><div class="path-line"></div><div class="path-item"><span class="path-type">JOB</span><strong>Data Analyst</strong></div><div class="path-line"></div><div class="path-item company-item"><span class="path-type">COMPANY</span><strong>Infosys</strong></div></div></article><article class="career-card"><div class="card-number">07</div><div class="path"><div class="path-item"><span class="path-type">SKILL</span><strong>React</strong></div><div class="path-line"></div><div class="path-item"><span class="path-type">JOB</span><strong>Frontend Developer</strong></div><div class="path-line"></div><div class="path-item company-item"><span class="path-type">COMPANY</span><strong>Google</strong></div></div></article><article class="career-card"><div class="card-number">08</div><div class="path"><div class="path-item"><span class="path-type">SKILL</span><strong>React</strong></div><div class="path-line"></div><div class="path-item"><span class="path-type">JOB</span><strong>Full Stack Developer</strong></div><div class="path-line"></div><div class="path-item company-item"><span class="path-type">COMPANY</span><strong>TCS</strong></div></div></article><article class="career-card"><div class="card-number">09</div><div class="path"><div class="path-item"><span class="path-type">SKILL</span><strong>SQL</strong></div><div class="path-line"></div><div class="path-item"><span class="path-type">JOB</span><strong>Data Analyst</strong></div><div class="path-line"></div><div class="path-item company-item"><span class="path-type">COMPANY</span><strong>Infosys</strong></div></div></artic